Write site/index.html and site/style.css by hand, in the style of an editorial page. Sections in order: hero (the tagline from content/pitch.md, one sentence, one primary call to action), how it works (the seven loop steps), the three tools (Terra, Playbook, Cartograph), evidence (only the numbers in content/evidence.json, each with what it means), get started. From content/brand.md: dark background, light text, exactly one accent for the CTA and small emphasis, system font stack only, single column with prose max width around 70 characters, quiet precise tone with no exclamation marks and no webfonts. No framework, bundler, or build step; HTML and CSS written by hand; the page reads the same with scripts off. Output site/index.html and site/style.css.
