Write piece.mid: an original 8-bar cantabile in 3/4, one stated key, single-line right hand over sustained left-hand chords, ending on a cadence. Perform it with rubato — stretch the bar of the melodic peak, slow the last two bars, keep the pulse elsewhere — and shape it by touch: loudest on the peak note, softest on the last melody note, left hand quieter and always below the line. Piano only (program 0). No quotation, no random pitches, no notes or write-up files.
