Compose an original short romantic piano character piece and write it as an expressive MIDI performance to piece.mid. Solo piano, one movement, about one to three minutes: a melody a person could sing, a left hand that is accompaniment rather than a copy of the right, a stated key and a form with a departure and a return, romantic harmony (a secondary dominant or a borrowed chord somewhere, a cadence that closes). Perform it, do not sequence it: notes of a chord do not share one timestamp, velocity is not one value, tempo is not one number, the sustain pedal changes with the harmony and lifts for the changes. No quotation of an existing piece. No notes, plan, or write-up files.
