mean inter onset interval  in quarter note beats  of the opening rhythmic cell  the first four distinct note on times in piece mid  three intervals  
how many later 3 interval windows in piece mid restate the opening cell  each successive ioi ratio within 20  of the opening cell s ratios  zero means the opening figure never returns 
smallest ratio of a returning cell s mean ioi to the opening cell s mean ioi  below 1 means a later statement is denser  1 if the figure never returns 
