Compose an original short romantic character piece and write it as piece.mid: piano only (GM program 0), a stated opening idea, a middle that leaves home on the circle of fifths, a return that is not a literal copy, one intensity peak rather than several, a stillness before or after that peak, an arrival on the home bass, and a played feel (velocities, pedal, onset scatter) rather than a grid. No quotation of an existing piece. No notes or write-up files.
