Compose an original short romantic character piece as expressive piano MIDI in piece.mid. Follow compose-romantic-piano-midi and compose-a-character-piece. A conservatory pianist could be given it to learn: one feeling stated, disturbed, and resolved late; a single climax; a return that is changed by the middle; harmony that leaves home by at least a fifth-relation and comes back; rhythm that tightens where it presses; a person at the instrument (many velocities, onsets not locked to a 16th grid, sustain pedal that changes with the harmony, hands not struck as one). No quotation of an existing piece. No notes, plan, or write-up files.
note piece sounding length notes pitch beat between first fraction grid intensity
